Package: endogCopulaPanel
Type: Package
Title: Panel Gaussian Copula Endogeneity Correction
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Ashwin", family = "Malshe", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "ashwin@malshe.com"),
    person(given = "Rouven E.", family = "Haschka", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
    comment = "Author of the reference implementation that the panel copula estimator in this package is ported from"))
Description: Implements the fixed-effects panel Gaussian copula estimator of
    Haschka (2022) <doi:10.1177/00222437211070820>, ported from that
    author's reference implementation. The estimator corrects for
    endogenous regressors in linear fixed-effects panel models without
    instrumental variables by transforming the data via forward orthogonal
    deviations and jointly estimating the regression and the copula
    dependence between the error and the endogenous regressors by maximum
    likelihood, with bootstrap standard errors computed in parallel. It
    builds on the shared machinery in 'endogCopula', reusing its formula
    parsing, marginal CDF estimators and diagnostics.
